<newsitem itemid="190288" id="root" date="1996-11-14" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: M.A.I.D Q3 pretax loss narrows.</title>
<headline>M.A.I.D Q3 pretax loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr loss (pence)	 2.62		   vs 3.68 loss</p>
<p> Pretax loss		2.4		    vs 3.4 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   5.2		    vs 3.8</p>
<p> Operating loss	   2.5		    vs 3.4 loss</p>
<p> Net taxed loss	   2.4		    vs 3.0 loss</p>
<p>		   Nine months to Sept 30</p>
<p> Shr (pence) loss	 6.30		   vs 3.34 loss</p>
<p> Pretax loss		5.7		    vs 3.0 loss</p>
<p> Turnover		   14.8		   vs 9.6</p>
<p> Operating loss	   6.4		    vs 3.1 loss</p>
<p> Net taxed loss	   5.8		    vs 2.7 loss</p>
<p>NOTE: M.A.I.D Plc, an online information service provider, said it added 825 new corporate subscribers in the current Q3, mainly in the U.S., versus 145 in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
